rientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" data-image-title="M5-Pro-and-Max-1" data-image-description="&lt;p&gt;Two square Apple chip illustrations on a black background: one labeled &amp;#8220;Apple M5 Pro&amp;#8221; with a blue gradient, the other labeled &amp;#8220;Apple M5 Max&amp;#8221; with a purple gradient.&lt;/p&gt;" data-image-caption="&lt;p&gt;Image Credit: Apple Inc.&lt;/p&gt;" data-large-file="https://applemagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/M5-Pro-and-Max-1-1024x683.jpg"/>
