ok-Pro-M5-4.jpg 1920w, https://applemagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/MacBook-Pro-M5-4-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://applemagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/MacBook-Pro-M5-4-768x512.jpg 768w, https://applemagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/MacBook-Pro-M5-4-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://applemagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/MacBook-Pro-M5-4-50x33.jpg 50w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px"/>
