              <div class="author-bio">
          <p>Ivan Castilho is an entrepreneur and long-time Apple user since 2007, with a background in management and marketing. He holds a degree and multiple MBAs in Digital Marketing and Strategic Management. With a natural passion for music, art, graphic design, and interface design, Ivan combines business expertise with a creative mindset. Passionate about tech and innovation, he enjoys writing about disruptive trends and consumer tech, particularly within the Apple ecosystem.</p>
